# 🏗 Architecture

```
            Client
               │
               ▼
        Gin HTTP Server
               │
        Authentication
        Authorization
               │
          REST API
               │
        Business Logic
               │
      Repository Layer
               │
         PostgreSQL
```

---

# 📅 Booking Workflow

```
Customer

↓

View Available Schedule

↓

Choose Schedule

↓

Send Booking Request

↓

Backend Validation

↓

Schedule Available?

├── YES
│
├── Save Booking
│
└── Booking Success

└── NO

Return Conflict Response
```

