# 🎯 Why This Project?

Managing schedules sounds simple until multiple users attempt to reserve the same time slot.

This project focuses on solving that challenge by implementing backend validation that prevents schedule conflicts while maintaining a clean role-based permission system.

It reflects real-world backend development practices commonly found in enterprise scheduling systems.

